T1  - Blockchain-Based Dynamic and Revocable Consent for Secondary Health Data Use: Systematic Review
AU  - Phuyal, Sudip
AU  - Bhandari, Manila
AU  - Bista, Rabindra
AU  - Ferreira, João Carlos
JO  - JMIR Medical Informatics
VL  - 14
