T1  - Stakeholder Perspectives on Affinity Domains in Digital Health Interoperability: Qualitative Study
AU  - Bruthans, Jan
AU  - Hospodková, Petra
AU  - Fejfarová, Ilona
JO  - JMIR Medical Informatics
VL  - 14
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/01/01/
