T1  - From documentation to discovery: clinicians’ perspectives on the generation, usability and standardization of real-world data
AU  - Ross, Elisabeth
AU  - Bouissou, Olivier
AU  - Helland, Åslaug
AU  - Faxvaag, Arild
JO  - International Journal of Medical Informatics
VL  - 217
